# GEO-INFER-EXAMPLES 🌟

[![License: CC BY-ND-SA 4.0](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-CC%20BY--ND--SA%204.0-lightgrey.svg)](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nd-sa/4.0/)
